@startuml
title MEDORA: Procedure Order Lifecycle
!include ../../../../shared/templates/medora-style.puml
skinparam dpi 192
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
state "Pending Allocation" as PendingAllocation
state "In Progress" as InProgress
state "Not Performed" as NotPerformed
[*] --> Created : create()
Created --> PendingAllocation : validate()\n[order data valid]
PendingAllocation --> PendingAllocation : allocate()\n[resource unavailable]
PendingAllocation --> Scheduled : allocate()\n[staff, room, and resource available]\n/ reserve resources
Scheduled --> InProgress : start()\n[assigned staff authorized]
InProgress --> Completed : recordOutcome()\n[required result complete]\n/ release resources
Scheduled --> Delayed : delay(reason)\n[authorized]\n/ retain or release reservation per policy
Delayed --> Scheduled : reallocate()\n[slot available]\n/ reserve resources
Created --> Canceled : cancel(reason)\n[authorized]
PendingAllocation --> Canceled : cancel(reason)\n[authorized]
Scheduled --> Canceled : cancel(reason)\n[authorized]\n/ release resources
InProgress --> NotPerformed : stop(reason)\n[reason recorded]\n/ release resources
Delayed --> Canceled : cancel(reason)\n[authorized]
Completed --> [*]
Canceled --> [*]
NotPerformed --> [*]
@enduml
